32.html)","x":-320,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-34","type":"text","text":"## 34｜圆弧碎束瓶颈刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/DX_eF6RqvZKMzTw1nKoOE-E4Xi8%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/Ignat_Bauer-Griffin-17afeac3b0804e769dc5ab524f28d70c.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/bottleneck-bangs-8765309)","x":260,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-45","type":"text","text":"## 45｜直落长刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/2EJyZT4zrKxADsRusztPGjdQHQQ%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/ElizabethOlsenfringe-618beeff9e524de6923f2d59d105975d.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/celebrity-hairstyles-featuring-fringe-bangs-345692)","x":-900,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-47","type":"text","text":"## 47｜标准中分长刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/F9bJ1UUj3GDr5C2aaAL8kTqfNmU%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/GettyImages-1467427449-98fff251a2f14b13af11f7ec67f0496b.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/celebrity-hairstyles-featuring-fringe-bangs-345692)","x":-320,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-66","type":"text","text":"## 66｜直落Birkin刘海\n\n![](https://media.vogue.co.uk/photos/66bde3546c5ab0bcc4bcd9e3/master/w_1600%2Cc_limit/GettyImages-110135314.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.vogue.co.uk/gallery/french-bangs-inspiration)","x":260,"y":1660,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-76","type":"text","text":"## 76｜倒U经典几何刘海\n\n![](https://media.allure.com/photos/6232117b77d96ce37a7e2da4/master/w_1600%2Cc_limit/GettyImages-1381870741.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.allure.com/story/the-best-bangs-tips-ever)","x":-900,"y":2440,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-88","type":"text","text":"## 88｜烫卷刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/7-permed-hair-with-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C654&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/wavy-hair-with-bangs/)","x":-320,"y":2440,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"group-yin","type":"group","label":"阴金 z｜7项｜原研究配图","x":-980,"y":3460,"width":1840,"height":2460,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-05","type":"text","text":"## 05｜Baby空气刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/9-long-asian-hairstyle-with-korean-bangs.jpg?resize=796%2C1031&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/korean-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":3560,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-17","type":"text","text":"## 17｜短帘幕刘海\n\n![](https://therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/13-feathered-curtain-bangs.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/curtain-bangs/)","x":-320,"y":3560,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-38","type":"text","text":"## 38｜短斜扫刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/Ky3LWFD6cCsVchX1mQbTTeHFFnc%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/GettyImages-903106746-bf89a6dbc9dd4dd8bb754888ebbde65f.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/side-swept-bangs-ideas-11903584)","x":260,"y":3560,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-50","type":"text","text":"## 50｜标准Baby刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/Jl-NOgBOvUX3QEKDetUgq8m7dUM%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/keke-1de244ca86a24095842d74e34c056c4c.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/ways-to-try-baby-bangs-11813484)","x":-900,"y":4340,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-56","type":"text","text":"## 56｜经典Micro刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1-pixie-bob-with-blunt-micro-bangs.jpg?resize=1190%2C1216&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/micro-bangs/)","x":-320,"y":4340,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"item-62","type":"text","text":"## 62｜短碎羽化刘